From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000003 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mortyzhaoyu <morty.zhaoyu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 17:55:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mpp: iep2: fix inverted roi buffer allocation check

iep2_init() prints "allocate roi buffer failed" when dma_alloc_coherent
succeeds (the condition is inverted). Fix the check so the error is
reported only on actual allocation failure.

Signed-off-by: mortyzhaoyu <morty.zhaoyu@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/video/rockchip/mpp/mpp_iep2.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/video/rockchip/mpp/mpp_iep2.c
+++ b/drivers/video/rockchip/mpp/mpp_iep2.c
@@ -893,7 +893,7 @@
 	iep->roi.vaddr = dma_alloc_coherent(mpp->dev, iep->roi.size,
 					    &iep->roi.iova,
 					    GFP_KERNEL);
-	if (iep->roi.vaddr) {
+	if (!iep->roi.vaddr) {
 		dev_err(mpp->dev, "allocate roi buffer failed\n");
 		//return -ENOMEM;
 	}
